{
  "file_id": "3554",
  "text_count": 158,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "We made it to Vamdemon's castle,\nbut it's gonna be hard to get us\nall in there.",
      "_offset": 7672,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "It doesn't seem like we'll be able\nto sneak in without being noticed.",
      "_offset": 7752,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "So then what are we gonna do?",
      "_offset": 7822,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Leave it to me!",
      "_offset": 7856,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Agumon...",
      "_offset": 7872,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "The castle's full of Digimon, so I\ncan sneak in if I go by myself!",
      "_offset": 7882,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "If we can infiltrate Vamdemon's\narmy, it may work out!",
      "_offset": 7949,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "I'm worried about Agumon going in\nthere alone, so I'm going in, too!",
      "_offset": 8004,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Are they gonna be okay?",
      "_offset": 8073,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Leave it to me! I may not look the\npart, but I'm pretty confident in\nmy acting skills!",
      "_offset": 8097,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Got it! If you find someplace you\nthink we can sneak in through,\ncome back here!",
      "_offset": 8184,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Okay! Wait for us!",
      "_offset": 8265,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Are they gonna be okay?",
      "_offset": 8284,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Recruiting Soldiers",
      "_offset": 8308,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "I don't know how many they must\nhave gathered by now, but it's\nbetter to be safe than sorry.",
      "_offset": 8328,
      "_length": 92,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "*sigh* They're a bunch of useless\ngrunts.",
      "_offset": 8421,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "No need to worry! I'll train 'em\nreal hard!",
      "_offset": 8463,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "I'm counting on you. Considering\nyour experience, you're the only\nsuitable teacher around here.",
      "_offset": 8507,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Indeed!",
      "_offset": 8603,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "All right then, I'll leave them in\nyour hands!",
      "_offset": 8611,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Hey, is it true you're recruiting\nsoldiers?",
      "_offset": 8658,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Can we join?",
      "_offset": 8702,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Hmm. They might be better than\nthis lot. Okay, get over here!",
      "_offset": 8715,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Okay, fresh meat, first you'll be\nrunning 100 laps! After that, 500\nbunny hops!",
      "_offset": 8777,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "What are we gonna do....",
      "_offset": 8857,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "At this rate, it desn't look like\nwe'll have a chance to get the\nothers inside.",
      "_offset": 8882,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "We have to do something about\nNanimon.",
      "_offset": 8962,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Hey, I was in a unit with him\nonce.",
      "_offset": 9001,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "...Tell us more.",
      "_offset": 9037,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "He kept getting drunk off alcohol,\nso he was completely useless in\nreal combat.",
      "_offset": 9054,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "So he's a heavy drinker.",
      "_offset": 9134,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "That might be what we need!",
      "_offset": 9159,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Lord Vamdemon, I am pleased to\nreport that we have gathered a\nmultitude of soldiers.",
      "_offset": 9192,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Are they of use to us?",
      "_offset": 9277,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "P-Probably...",
      "_offset": 9300,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Ahahaha...",
      "_offset": 9314,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Can you even call them soldiers?\nAre you trying to make a B-team or\nsomething?",
      "_offset": 9325,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Ugh, if you keep talking like\nthat, I'm gonna...",
      "_offset": 9404,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "What? You wanna go?",
      "_offset": 9453,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Stop. Anyway, Tailmon, did you\nfind anyone useful?",
      "_offset": 9473,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Yes, as instructed. I've traveled\naround and scouted a number of\nrespected veterans.",
      "_offset": 9524,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "I look forward to meeting them.",
      "_offset": 9609,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Yes, sir!",
      "_offset": 9641,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Hahaha!",
      "_offset": 9651,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Are they still in there?!",
      "_offset": 9659,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "I'm getting impatient.",
      "_offset": 9685,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Hm?",
      "_offset": 9708,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Sorry to keep you waiting!",
      "_offset": 9712,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Palmon! You made it!",
      "_offset": 9739,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "You did it!",
      "_offset": 9760,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Just a second! Poison Ivy!",
      "_offset": 9772,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Grab onto the vines and get in\nhere!",
      "_offset": 9799,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Okay! ...gh!",
      "_offset": 9836,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Is this gonna hold?",
      "_offset": 9849,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "It'll be fine, hurry! We're in a\nbit of a tight situation here!",
      "_offset": 9869,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "O-okay ...ughh!",
      "_offset": 9933,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Whew, we got everyone in. I'm\ntired...",
      "_offset": 9949,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "So this is how we do it!\nAll right, let's head in!",
      "_offset": 9988,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 10039,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "This is a huge castle...",
      "_offset": 10045,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Yeah, and there might be some\ntraps around here. Be careful.",
      "_offset": 10070,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "All right, I'll go check it out!",
      "_offset": 10131,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "You go first, Yamato.",
      "_offset": 10164,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "All right, I'll go check it out!",
      "_offset": 10186,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "No, I'll go!",
      "_offset": 10219,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Yamato...",
      "_offset": 10232,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Taichi, if you take the lead,\nwe'll all get caught in some trap.",
      "_offset": 10242,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Ahahaha!",
      "_offset": 10307,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Don't you start laughing too,\nAgumon!",
      "_offset": 10316,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "You go first, Yamato.",
      "_offset": 10354,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "What?! Yamato, are you okay with\nthis?",
      "_offset": 10376,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Yamato will do a better job of\nbeing careful around Vamdemon's\nminions.",
      "_offset": 10415,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "We're all good and bad at\ndifferent things. Taichi knows his\nstrengths and weaknesses, right?",
      "_offset": 10487,
      "_length": 93,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "See, even I can be more of an\nadult sometimes!",
      "_offset": 10581,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Hm? What's this?",
      "_offset": 10628,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Is it safe to approach?",
      "_offset": 10645,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "It seems like it transfers you to\nanother space, like a warp point.",
      "_offset": 10669,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "I don't think it's dangerous per\nse, but if we use it carelessly,\nwe may get lost.",
      "_offset": 10737,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "I guess we'll have to be careful.",
      "_offset": 10820,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "There ought to be a map.",
      "_offset": 10854,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "I guess we'll have to be careful\nabout going forward.",
      "_offset": 10879,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Yes, we need to remember the\nlocations of the warp entry and\nexit points.",
      "_offset": 10933,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "There ought to be a map with\nproper directions.",
      "_offset": 11007,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "No, it's probably a puzzle to keep\nout thieves, so we'll have to\nmemorize all of the directions.",
      "_offset": 11055,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "So we've got no choice but to keep\ngoing, right?",
      "_offset": 11152,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "It seems so.",
      "_offset": 11201,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "This place is considerably\nstrange. The space here is\ndistorted and twisted.",
      "_offset": 11214,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "This world's weird enough, it\ndoesn't need this on top of it!",
      "_offset": 11291,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "There's something special about \nthis place. Is it because \nVamdemon's power is stronger here?",
      "_offset": 11353,
      "_length": 94,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Don't say things like that. It's\ntoo scary!",
      "_offset": 11448,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Anyway, let's keep going!",
      "_offset": 11492,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "The time is nigh! We shall depart!",
      "_offset": 11518,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Yes!",
      "_offset": 11553,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Yes!",
      "_offset": 11558,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Our objective is the eighth Chosen\nChild! Their corpse will be the\nbase of my grand ambitions!",
      "_offset": 11563,
      "_length": 94,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Everything will be consumed by the\npower of darkness!",
      "_offset": 11658,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 11712,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Tlon, Uqbar, Orbis Tertius!",
      "_offset": 11718,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Now, we depart!",
      "_offset": 11746,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Waaaaaaaaaaait! We won't let you\ndo that!",
      "_offset": 11762,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "So you're finally here...But\nyou're too late. Observe this\nhistoric moment!",
      "_offset": 11804,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Don't mess with us!",
      "_offset": 11880,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Unfortunately, I don't have the\ntime to deal with you.\nPicoDevimon!",
      "_offset": 11900,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Yes, sir!",
      "_offset": 11968,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Wanna fight us again?",
      "_offset": 11978,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "This won't be like last time!\nNanimon, I'll leave 'em to you!",
      "_offset": 12000,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Got it! You losers are in the way!\nGet out, you rascals!",
      "_offset": 12062,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "I surrender, I surrender!",
      "_offset": 12119,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Nanimon! You can't do that!",
      "_offset": 12145,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "They say retreating is winning in\nits own way! Now, excuse meeeeeee!",
      "_offset": 12173,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "So, what are you gonna do?",
      "_offset": 12242,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "S-so sneaky! There's so many of\nyou here...",
      "_offset": 12269,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Come on, we don't have the time\nfor this. Let's take him down!",
      "_offset": 12313,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
